    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;\r\nproposed development, by reason of its siting in&amp;nbsp;surface water flood risk\r\nzone, in the absence of an &lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;adequate Flood Risk\r\nAssessment to assess the future impacts and provide adequate mitigation\r\nmeasures, would be likely to result in the displacement of water onto\r\nadjacent land and fail to provide resilience to flooding, to the detriment of\r\nthe safety of future occupiers of the application site and adjacent sites,\r\ncontrary to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Policies S1 12 and SI 13 of the London Plan\r\n(2021), Policy CS1.U of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), and &amp;nbsp;Policies DM9\r\nand DM10 of the Development Management Policies Local Plan document (2013).&lt;/p&gt;"
